{#-
  Vacuum room maps — segment id, display name, short label, icon, labels
  for each vacuum. Deployed to custom_templates/vacuum_rooms.jinja by the
  sync script.

  This is the owner of the room lists. `packages/vacuum.yaml` renders both the
  room_config sensor's state (the room count) and its `rooms` attribute from
  this macro, so the count can't drift out of step with the list.

  `short` is used where horizontal space is tight, like live queue chips.

  `labels` is a list of group tags for preset chip filtering.
  A room can belong to zero or more groups. Add new labels here and a matching
  preset chip in dashboard.yaml.

  Segment ID's come from the device manufacturer app. Each vacuum is assumed to
  only be on a single floor/map.
-#}
